  "details": "On the VRChat website and on the VRChat phone app, the calendar no longer shows events from groups I am a member of.\n\nInstead, I am seeing only events that are Features and events that my own group has made. \n\nIt appears that, in game (in PCVR and on Android cell phone) the Calendar is operating as expected. \n\nWhat is stranger still is that only SOME of the Featured events appear to be visible at a time on the website and Android phone calendar and if I refresh or wait a few hours and look at the calendar again, it will be a different selection of a few Featured events. \n\nEvents from my own group always appear visible and appear to be working correctly. \n\nPlease let me know if you need anymore information.",
